<#BalkRuleMap> a rr:TriplesMap ; rml:logicalSource <#RootSource> ; rr:subjectMap [ rr:constant <https://baseballontology.org/data/rule/balk> ; rr:termType rr:IRI ; rr:class base:BalkRule ] .

